const resellerCategoryNames={vehicles:'Автомобили',homes:'Недвижимость',items:'Предметы',clothes:'Одежда',atms:'Банкоматы',businesses:'Бизнесы',offices:'Офисы и склады'};
let resellerPickerKind='vehicles',resellerPickerItems=[],resellerPickerSelected=null,resellerPickerPage=1,resellerPickerHasMore=false,resellerPickerTimer,resellerPickerRequest=0,resellerPickerLoading=false;
const WIKI_LOCAL_KEY='fleet-wiki-catalog-v1';
const readLocalCatalog=()=>{try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(WIKI_LOCAL_KEY))||{}}catch{return{}}};
const writeLocalCatalog=value=>localStorage.setItem(WIKI_LOCAL_KEY,JSON.stringify(value));
const catalogWarmers=new Map();
function localCatalogItems(kind){return readLocalCatalog()[kind]?.items||[]}
function filterLocalCatalog(kind,q){const needle=q.trim().toLocaleLowerCase('ru-RU');return localCatalogItems(kind).map(item=>{const matchedVariant=needle?(item.variants||[]).find(variant=>(variant.name||'').toLocaleLowerCase('ru-RU').includes(needle)):null;return{...item,_matchedVariant:matchedVariant||null,_baseMatches:!needle||`${item.name} ${item.id} ${(item.details||[]).join(' ')}`.toLocaleLowerCase('ru-RU').includes(needle)}}).filter(item=>item._baseMatches||item._matchedVariant)}
function warmLocalCatalog(kind,force=false){
  if(kind==='vehicles'||catalogWarmers.has(kind)||!window.desktop?.getWikiCatalog)return catalogWarmers.get(kind);
  const job=(async()=>{
    const initial=readLocalCatalog()[kind]||{},hadCatalog=!!(initial.complete&&initial.items?.length),known=new Set((initial.items||[]).map(x=>`${x.id}:${x.name}`)),newItems={...(initial.newItems||{})};
    const cutoff=Date.now()-30*864e5;for(const [key,at] of Object.entries(newItems))if(at<cutoff)delete newItems[key];
    let page=force?1:(initial.nextPage||1),hasMore=force?!initial.syncing:!initial.complete;
    if(force)hasMore=true;
    while(hasMore){
      const data=await window.desktop.getWikiCatalog(kind,'',page),store=readLocalCatalog(),saved=store[kind]||{},merged=new Map((saved.items||[]).map(x=>[`${x.id}:${x.name}`,x]));
      for(const item of data.items||[]){const key=`${item.id}:${item.name}`;if(hadCatalog&&!known.has(key))newItems[key]=Date.now();merged.set(key,item)}
      hasMore=!!data.hasMore;
      store[kind]={items:[...merged.values()],complete:!hasMore,nextPage:page+1,newItems,updatedAt:Date.now()};writeLocalCatalog(store);
      if(resellerPickerKind===kind&&$('#resellerDealDialog').open){const q=$('#resellerDealSearch').value.trim();resellerPickerItems=filterLocalCatalog(kind,q).slice(0,400);renderResellerPicker()}
      page++;if(page>250)break;
    }
  })().catch(()=>{}).finally(()=>catalogWarmers.delete(kind));
  catalogWarmers.set(kind,job);return job;
}
